  <main>

    <section class="about-us">

      <h2>
        <span class="accent">About</span> Fran
      </h2>

      <p>
        Francine Miller founded Fran‚Äôs Flowers in 1995 with the dream
        of creating a warm and welcoming flower shop for the San Francisco community.
      </p>

      <p>
        Inspired by nature and meaningful connections,
        Fran carefully designs every arrangement with creativity and care.
      </p>

      <p>
        Today, Fran‚Äôs Flowers continues to brighten special moments
        with handcrafted bouquets and community support across the Bay Area.
      </p>

    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>

    <h3>Fran's Flowers</h3>

    <p>
      Brightening lives one flower at a time.
    </p>

